<title>UK: PPL extends sheep-cloning gains.</title>
<headline>PPL extends sheep-cloning gains.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in PPL Therapeutics Plc continued higher on Tuesday, extending gains on the back of the company's sheep-cloning breakthrough announcement on Monday, traders said.</p>
<p>PPL shares were 37-1/2p higher at 425p by 1140 GMT.  </p>
<p>Shares in the pharmaceutical firm rose 52-1/2p on Monday, after the company confirmed it had carried out the first-ever cloning of an adult sheep thanks to a breakthrough in genetic science.</p>
<p>-- Simon Gardner, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
